[agent:result] === files upload ===
[agent:result] Usage: hops files upload [OPTIONS] LOCAL_PATH REMOTE_PATH
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Upload a local file to HopsFS.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   ``REMOTE_PATH`` is the destination path (``cp``/``scp``-style), not the
[agent:result]   parent directory. When its basename matches the local file's basename the
[agent:result]   parent is used as the SDK's ``upload_path``; otherwise the remote path is
[agent:result]   passed through unchanged and the SDK treats it as a directory (file lands
